    <!--
    Google Sign-In / Drive Backup Configuration:
    To enable Google Drive backup, you must configure a real Google Cloud project.
    See app/src/main/java/com/example/backup/CloudBackupManager.kt for detailed setup instructions.

    1. Create a Google Cloud project: https://console.cloud.google.com
    2. Enable "Google Identity" API
    3. Create an OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID
    4. Add your Android package name + SHA-1 fingerprint to the OAuth client
    5. Set the Web Client ID below (or in local.properties as GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID)

    Until configured, Google Sign-In and Drive backup are DISABLED.
    -->
    <string name="google_web_client_id">YOUR_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com</string>
</resources>
